  "description": "One OCO row of GetPendingGTTOrder (input.list 'pending', a Gtt) or GetTrgOi ('triggered', a TriggeredGtt), input.row the wire object, parsed as a list item. expected: alert_id, is_oco, oco_first and oco_second (the legs place_order_params / place_order_params_leg2 as {quantity, price, trigger_price}, or null), oco_triggers (the oivariable items as {var_name, trigger_value}, or null), stop_loss and target ({leg: 'first' or 'second', trigger_value}, or null). A nested record that fails to parse (a leg value, a leg that is not an object, a trigger value) is null AS A WHOLE, not field by field: the leg (or the whole trigger list) is null, so both sides are null, and the row itself still parses (sdk-behaviour.md 2.9). Decimal values are compared as decimal numbers ('1430.00' equals '1430').",
